@startuml
title Evaluation of the LLM4EHR RAG Pipeline Using RAGAS

actor Researcher
participant "Golden Test Dataset" as Dataset
participant "RAG System" as RAG
participant "Retriever" as Retriever
participant "Generator LLM" as Generator
participant "RAGAS Evaluator" as Ragas
participant "Judge LLM" as Judge
participant "Embedding Model" as Embedder
database "Evaluation Results" as Results

Researcher -> Dataset: Select evaluation questions
Dataset --> Researcher: Questions and reference answers

loop Each evaluation question
    Researcher -> RAG: Submit question

    RAG -> Retriever: Retrieve relevant contexts
    Retriever --> RAG: Ranked contexts

    RAG -> Generator: Generate grounded response
    Generator --> RAG: Generated answer

    RAG --> Researcher: Answer and retrieved contexts

    Researcher -> Ragas: Question, answer,\ncontexts and reference

    Ragas -> Judge: Evaluate faithfulness
    Judge --> Ragas: Claim support decisions

    Ragas -> Judge: Evaluate context recall
    Judge --> Ragas: Reference-claim coverage

    Ragas -> Judge: Evaluate context precision
    Judge --> Ragas: Context relevance decisions

    Ragas -> Judge: Generate questions from answer
    Judge --> Ragas: Synthetic questions
    Ragas -> Embedder: Compare synthetic and\noriginal questions
    Embedder --> Ragas: Similarity scores

    Ragas -> Results: Store metric scores
end

Results --> Researcher: Aggregate and\nper-question evaluation

@enduml